{"page":87,"w":7029,"h":11508,"lines":[{"x":0.049881246079958634,"text":"in this old world. Just as Christ died to this world, so it is","conf":1,"y":0.9287790697369398,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.02186577187644112},{"w":0.8150604049880783,"text":"true of us to say: \"You have died and your life is hid with","y":0.90580193449504276,"h":0.02555382251739502,"x":0.052097862832302874,"conf":1},{"x":0.054631832298320596,"w":0.21615201776677917,"y":0.88808139597440616,"h":0.01891265123609509,"text":"Christ in God.\"","conf":1},{"y":0.86185515838661908,"text":"To believe in this hidden inner life is the very mark of the","x":0.083135387191108745,"w":0.78622327532087066,"conf":1,"h":0.02186577187644112},{"h":0.021923449304368847,"text":"Christian, and Sunday assures us of the reality of this hidden","conf":1,"x":0.054631821590411411,"y":0.83854166646014494,"w":0.81472684191418931},{"w":0.81947742808948854,"text":"life. But we are called to bear witness to this hidden life, and","y":0.81540697710875887,"x":0.049881238853117883,"h":0.023255813689458948,"conf":1},{"conf":1,"x":0.052256537105364029,"w":0.81710211023107759,"h":0.021871538389296785,"text":"precisely by this means, namely, that we keep Sunday as the","y":0.79360465167734673},{"w":0.81947742808948876,"conf":1,"text":"Lord's Day on which this new beginning, divinely bestowed,","h":0.023313492063492092,"x":0.052256545604899118,"y":0.77033730140461487},{"text":"is again and again appropriated and honoured by us as a","conf":1,"x":0.04988123628185908,"y":0.74851190495142728,"h":0.021836931743319021,"w":0.81947742808948865},{"x":0.052256539998136134,"w":0.81710211023107737,"h":0.020406514879256932,"conf":1,"text":"real new beginning in our earthly life. Let us with the poet!","y":0.72668650794146128},{"x":0.05225653697649478,"conf":1,"y":0.70337301585951306,"text":"invoke Sunday thus:","w":0.28741090947931464,"h":0.021917681845407655},{"text":"\"To all who wander in dismay","w":0.42821061765992796,"h":0.022785315437922393,"conf":1,"y":0.67136810111713108,"x":0.19439381126812436},{"h":0.018941491369217189,"y":0.6497093027331271,"conf":1,"text":"Thou shalt be a home.","w":0.31591447607263345,"x":0.24465559251593968},{"h":0.020348836505223789,"y":0.62500000009767875,"x":0.21377671959808986,"w":0.47268409233588671,"conf":1,"text":"Receive them in thy house of light"},{"w":0.4513063802347555,"conf":1,"text":"From shadows where they roam.","h":0.020371908233279279,"y":0.60317460300625125,"x":0.24465559283986699},{"text":"\"To all week-day wanderers,","y":0.56810996259082014,"h":0.023686501714918262,"w":0.40235606106844812,"conf":1,"x":0.19193389062672075},{"conf":1,"text":"Burdened though they be,","y":0.54651162825901589,"w":0.35866982596261165,"h":0.020452657389262496,"x":0.24465558839297311},{"conf":1,"x":0.21615202493343616,"y":0.52325581423912004,"w":0.38717339255593036,"h":0.021883074253324475,"text":"With thy seraph army bring"},{"h":0.020371908233279168,"conf":1,"w":0.23515438723873783,"text":"A day of victory.","x":0.24465558715769253,"y":0.50145348874489648},{"y":0.46689279538026018,"w":0.45906666346958702,"h":0.024490285487402064,"text":"\"To all souls that sought for love","conf":1,"x":0.19204337736160193},{"h":0.020389211556268161,"w":0.32779096628164317,"y":0.4461805557879136,"text":"Six long wretched days","x":0.24465558817746813,"conf":1},{"text":"Thou shalt come with seven lights","conf":1,"x":0.21352746042865153,"y":0.42401362419604516,"w":0.46847856199586546,"h":0.023609116909995898},{"x":0.24703089111037943,"conf":1,"w":0.36342041213791088,"text":"And seven harps of praise.","y":0.40104166684268638,"h":0.020585317460317443},{"x":0.1923990430643385,"y":0.3677325585995852,"conf":1,"w":0.4275534493582589,"text":"\"Everyone that longs for home","h":0.021900377576313357},{"x":0.24940617578214083,"h":0.020354604910290397,"y":0.34447674436851206,"text":"Lead with gentle hand.","conf":1,"w":0.32304038010634384},{"conf":1,"text":"Show to us the wondrous mountains","x":0.21356431745053145,"y":0.32385563162316289,"h":0.020412909606146501,"w":0.49918053366921161},{"w":0.28028503021636564,"conf":1,"x":0.24703087956436551,"y":0.30232558176396174,"h":0.01889534791310632,"text":"Of that other land.\""},{"conf":1,"y":0.27470930260827975,"h":0.014534883082859107,"w":0.19002374426110991,"x":0.35866983570792488,"text":"1 Gustav Schüler."},{"text":"9I","x":0.44418052345295567,"y":0.068313954234854424,"w":0.035629452048958121,"h":0.01744185932098874,"conf":1}]}